Selected story/work item: `US-038 Data, Auth, and Tenancy Foundation`  
Lane: high-risk story, bounded approved follow-up slice.

Implemented one bounded vertical slice: an injected student TARA order-entry server query executor over parsed RLS-backed row inputs.

Changed:
- Added `executeStudentTaraOrderEntryQuery` in `app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/student-tara-order-entry-query.ts`.
  - Requires student session plus class/fund/month scope.
  - Reads injected own-fund, own-holding, pending-order, and tracked-metric rows.
  - Parses every unknown row before use.
  - Rejects non-student sessions, missing scope, other-fund order rows, duplicate pending orders, duplicate holdings/funds, and missing Apex unrealized gain metrics.
  - Returns only the existing safe student TARA order-entry query result envelope.
- Added unit coverage in `app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/student-tara-order-entry-query.test.ts`.
- Updated relevant status/evidence docs, including `README.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `docs/TEST_MATRIX.md`, product docs, backlog, and US-038 story files.
- Corrected `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` to reflect that bounded application/infrastructure slices now exist.

